@title Release 4.2 go/no-go
# Release 4.2 go/no-go

Six answers are needed before the window opens. Fill them in and copy the result back to the agent.

ask owner | Who signs off on this release?
choose risk | low, medium, high
choose region | "us-east-1 (primary, 60% of traffic)", "eu-west-1 (secondary)", "ap-southeast-2" | Which region goes first?
confirm migration | The migration ran on staging and rolled back cleanly in under four minutes with no replication lag
confirm oncall | On-call for the release window is staffed
ask notes lines=4 | Anything the release notes should carry?

export json
export markdown
